ease gates."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The classification is routing evidence, not a claim that static inspection proves runtime behavior."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Lossless source-script adapters"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`vn_script_adapter.py` extracts plain KiriKiri `.ks`, Ren'Py `.rpy`, and NScripter `0.txt` text into"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" UTF-8 JSONL while preserving source hash, line hash, path, line number, encoding, BOM, newline, pre"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"fix, and suffix. Apply always writes to a separate output root and fails if the source changed."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"It does not open XP3/NSA archives or claim compiled-script support."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Safe translation migration after game updates"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"`vn_translation_memory.py` carries reviewed translations from one or more prior releases into a newl"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"y extracted catalog without silently guessing. Repeat `--previous` to combine histories. Exact confl"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"icts across releases stay empty and return a non-zero status; fuzzy matches remain review-only. Ever"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"y input remains unchanged and every catalog SHA-256 is recorded. The optional UTF-8 BOM CSV opens cl"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"eanly in Excel/WPS and keeps blank reviewer columns for decisions."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Strict translation preflight"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"`vn_qa.py` rejects missing, added, or reordered control tokens by default. v3 adds glossary and forb"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"idden-term gates, repeated-source consistency, character/line budgets, punctuation balance, empty tr"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"anslations, residual Japanese, and target-encoding checks. Generic JSON/JSONL, script-adapter JSONL,"},{"id":"p39s4","text":" and GalTransl cache fields are supported without third-party packages."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"An intentionally broken synthetic fixture produces a concise failure report:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### Release evidence, not another translator"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The bundled workflow also provides:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- `vn_patch.py` — hash-bound file replacement, verification, backup, and rollback;\n- `vn_image_qa.py"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"` — PNG/APNG, JPEG, GIF, and BMP geometry/alpha/frame comparison;\n- `vn_slot_qa.py` — fixed-slot ter"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"minator, padding, marker, and outside-region checks;\n- focused routes for AI6WIN, BGI/Ethornell, Dir"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"ector, RealLive, Delphi/DirectDraw, PSP/Vita, Ren'Py, KiriKiri, and custom engines."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

